{"id":8806,"date":"2024-06-18T07:00:00","date_gmt":"2024-06-18T07:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/?p=8806"},"modified":"2026-05-27T09:54:02","modified_gmt":"2026-05-27T09:54:02","slug":"bathroom-remodeling-tips-for-homeowners","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/bathroom-remodeling-tips-for-homeowners\/","title":{"rendered":"Bathroom Remodeling Tips for Homeowners"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Embarking on a bathroom remodel is a thrilling endeavor, but it can also pose its challenges, especially when balancing budget constraints with the desire for a stunning and practical space. From selecting the ideal contractor to sourcing durable materials, there are numerous considerations to weigh to ensure your bathroom renovation exceeds expectations without breaking the bank. At <a href=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/bathroom-remodeling\/\" title=\"\">Harris &amp; Sons,<\/a> we&#8217;re committed to guiding you through every step of your remodeling journey, offering our expertise and dedication to bring your vision to life.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In this comprehensive guide, we&#8217;ll provide expert tips and insights tailored to homeowners like you, whether you reside in Bend, OR, <a href=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/best-construction-services-in-tigard\/\">Tigard, OR<\/a>, or any locale in between. Our goal is to empower you with the knowledge and strategies needed to navigate your bathroom remodeling project with confidence and success.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/worker-remodeling-bathroom-2023-11-27-05-01-37-utc-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"home improvement\" class=\"wp-image-8810\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Choose a Contractor with Experience<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Central to the success of your bathroom remodel is the careful selection of a contractor. Choosing a seasoned professional can significantly impact the outcome and efficiency of your project. At Harris &amp; Sons, we specialize in bathroom renovations, offering a wealth of experience and expertise to bring your vision to life. With a proven track record in delivering exceptional results, we pride ourselves on adhering to the latest best practices in bathroom remodeling.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As you evaluate potential contractors, don&#8217;t hesitate to inquire about their portfolio of past projects and request references from satisfied clients. It&#8217;s essential to ensure they carry the necessary insurance and are well-equipped to handle your specific needs. At <a title=\"\" href=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/\"><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/services\/\">Harris &amp; Sons<\/a>, we&#8217;re committed to transparency, providing clear insights into our hourly rates and the high-quality materials we utilize. Homeowners in Gresham, OR, and Oregon City, OR, can rely on our local expertise and sterling reputation within the community to deliver outstanding bathroom transformations.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">When you choose <a href=\"https:\/\/share.google\/gwM2ovux57i85a4fn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Harris &amp; Sons<\/a>, you&#8217;re not just selecting a contractor \u2013 you&#8217;re partnering with a dedicated team that&#8217;s passionate about bringing your bathroom remodeling dreams to fruition. With our unwavering commitment to excellence and a portfolio of successful projects to showcase, we&#8217;re ready to embark on this journey with you. Let&#8217;s turn your bathroom into a sanctuary of style and functionality together.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Choose the Right Materials<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Selecting high-quality bathroom materials is essential for a long-lasting and visually appealing remodel. Before starting your renovation, decide on the scope of work. Are you simply installing new fixtures, or are you planning a complete overhaul? Your answer will influence the types of materials you should use.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Durable bathroom remodeling materials like ceramic tiles can withstand heavy use and require less maintenance over time compared to vinyl tiles. While ceramic tiles might be more expensive upfront, their longevity can make them a more cost-effective choice in the long run. For eco-friendly options, consider using recycled or sustainable materials that are both stylish and environmentally responsible.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Know Your Budget<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Setting a realistic budget is a cornerstone of bathroom remodel financial planning. This budget should include both materials and labor costs. If you&#8217;re hiring a contractor, ensure they provide a detailed estimate and clarify any potential additional expenses. Asking for recommendations from friends and family can also help you find experienced home renovation contractors in your area, such as those in Sisters, OR, or Beaverton, OR.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/worker-with-large-driller-2023-11-27-05-34-20-utc-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"home improvement experts\" class=\"wp-image-8811\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plan Ahead<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Proper planning is key to a successful and stress-free remodel. Before you begin, make a comprehensive list of all the materials and tools you\u2019ll need, from paint and tiles to plumbing fixtures and lighting. Writing down the cost of each item will help you keep track of your expenses and prevent any surprises down the line.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Effective bathroom remodeling strategies also involve scheduling your project during a time when disruptions will be minimal. Planning ahead ensures you have ample time to address any unexpected issues that may arise.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Have Realistic Expectations<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Understanding the scope and cost of your remodel is essential for maintaining realistic expectations. Major bathroom renovations, which might involve tearing down walls and relocating plumbing, can cost upwards of $30,000. However, if your goal is to refresh the space with new fixtures or updated tile, you can accomplish a lot with a budget of $12,000 to $25,000.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For homeowners in West Linn, OR, and Happy Valley, OR, knowing your financial limits and what you hope to achieve will guide your decisions and help you avoid overspending.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Additional Tips for a Successful Bathroom Remodel<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Bathroom Design Tips:<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Incorporate both functionality and aesthetics in your design. Features like floating vanities, frameless glass showers, and recessed lighting can create a modern and spacious feel.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Use neutral colors for a timeless look, and add pops of color with accessories like towels and rugs.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. DIY Bathroom Remodeling Tips:<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>If you&#8217;re handy, consider tackling smaller projects yourself to save on labor costs. Painting, installing a new vanity, or updating fixtures are DIY-friendly tasks that can significantly cut costs.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/man-laying-tiles-on-a-bathroom-wall-diy-concept-2023-11-27-05-23-15-utc-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"bathroom remodeling services\n\" class=\"wp-image-8813\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Budget-Friendly Bathroom Renovation Tips:<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Reuse existing fixtures where possible. A fresh coat of paint on cabinets or reglazing a bathtub can make old items look new.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Shop for materials at discount stores or during sales. Look for clearance items or consider buying gently used fixtures from places like Habitat for Humanity ReStores.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Selecting Materials for Bathroom Renovation:<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Invest in high-traffic areas. Spend more on durable flooring and countertops, while opting for budget-friendly options in less-used areas.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Choose stylish yet cost-effective materials like laminate countertops that mimic the look of more expensive stone surfaces.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5. Bathroom Renovation Guide for Homeowners:<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Stay organized by keeping a renovation journal. Document your budget, receipts, and timelines to ensure everything stays on track.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Regularly communicate with your contractor to monitor progress and address any issues promptly.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Conclusion<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Transforming your bathroom into a stylish and functional retreat doesn&#8217;t have to break the bank or induce stress. At <a href=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/\" title=\"\">Harris &amp; Sons<\/a>, we specialize in turning renovation visions into reality, offering expert guidance and unparalleled craftsmanship every step of the way. Our team is dedicated to delivering exceptional results, ensuring that your bathroom remodel exceeds expectations while staying within your budget constraints.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Whether you reside in Sisters, OR, Hillsboro, OR, or Happy Valley, OR, our <a href=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/bathroom-remodeling\/\">bathroom remodel services<\/a> are tailored to meet your unique needs and preferences. From concept to completion, we prioritize careful planning, meticulous attention to detail, and transparent communication to ensure a seamless renovation experience.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Embarking on a bathroom remodel is a thrilling endeavor, but it can also pose its challenges, especially when balancing budget constraints with the desire for a stunning and practical space. From selecting the ideal contractor to sourcing durable materials, there are numerous considerations to weigh to ensure your bathroom renovation exceeds expectations without breaking the [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":8809,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"categories":[30],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-8806","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-bathroom-resources"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/8806","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=8806"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/8806\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":16325,"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/8806\/revisions\/16325"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/med